{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23690","headline":"将发洛中枉令狐相公手札兼辱二篇宠行以长句答之 · 白居易","name":"将发洛中枉令狐相公手札兼辱二篇宠行以长句答之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尺素忽惊来梓泽，双金不惜送蓬山。\n八行落泊飞云雨，五字枪鏦动佩环。\n玉韵乍听堪醒酒，银钩细读当披颜。\n收藏便作终身宝，何啻三年怀袖间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}